nown as land use codes, are used by the city for assessment and zoning purposes. For residential properties in Milwaukee, the general classification is typically \\\"Residential\\\". The City of Milwaukee's zoning code and land use code tables provide detailed descriptions of these classifications. You can find the specific zoning for the property through the city's MapMilwaukee application, accessible through the Property Records page.\\n\\n**How to Search:**\\n\\n1.  Navigate to one of the official portals listed above.\\n2.  Locate the property search function, which typically allows you to search by street address.\\n3.  Enter \\\"2617 N 20th St\\\" and select \\\"Milwaukee\\\" if prompted.\\n4.  The search results should provide the detailed property report, which will contain the information you are looking for.\\n\\nPlease be aware that some non-official real estate websites may display information for a similarly named street in a different city, so it is important to use the official City of Milwaukee and Milwaukee County websites for accurate data.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"finishReason\": \"STOP\",\n  \"groundingMetadata\": {\n    \"webSearchQueries\": [\n      \"2617 N 20th St, Milwaukee, WI 53206 official property records\",\n      \"Milwaukee County tax assessor \\\"2617 N 20th St, 53206\\\"\",\n      \"City of Milwaukee property information \\\"2617 N 20th St, 53206\\\"\",\n      \"2617 N 20th St, Milwaukee, WI 53206 building permits\",\n      \"Milwaukee County property search \\\"2617 N 20th St\\\"\",\n      \"City of Milwaukee building permits \\\"2617 N 20th St, Milwaukee, WI 53206\\\"\",\n      \"Milwaukee County tax assessor records \\\"2617 N 20th St, Milwaukee, WI 53206\\\"\",\n      \"City of Milwaukee property search \\\"2617 N 20th St, Milwaukee, WI 53206\\\"\",\n      \"Milwaukee property classification codes\",\n      \"2617 N 20th St Milwaukee WI 53206 property information\",\n      \"2617 N 20th St Milwaukee WI 53206 property classif